 "remarks": "Welcome to 38 Carlisle Place, a charming 3-bedroom, 2-bath Cape offering an inviting blend of character, updates and versatility. Inside, enjoy hardwood floors, a beautifully updated eat-in kitchen with quartz countertops, a bright sunroom with French doors, and a full bath on each level. The expansive upper-level primary bedroom offers exciting potential for a future 4-bedroom layout. Outside, a newly improved backyard and beautiful new stonework create the perfect setting for entertaining and outdoor living. Additional highlights include a newer roof and boiler, attached garage, private driveway, and a large unfinished basement offering exceptional storage and future possibilities. Convenient to shopping, dining, parks and transportation.",
